      <definition>adj. and n. Jealous; possessive, stingy, greedy; jealousy; Stinginess; regret</definition>
      <page>934</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠷᠠᠮ ᠺᠦᠷᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- kyrky</transcript>
          <definition> To become jealous, stingy, or regretful</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠷᠠᠮ ᠦᠭᠡᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- ygei</transcript>
          <definition> Unstinted[ly], lavish[ly], without with-holding anything.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠡᠳ ᠲᠠᠸᠠᠷ ᠎ᠲᠤᠷ ᠮᠠᠰᠢ ᠬᠠᠷᠠᠮ</unicode>
          <transcript>ed tavar tur masi -- </transcript>
          <definition> Very greedy for riches.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠰᠡᠳᠺᠢᠯ ᠬᠠᠷᠠᠮ ᠦᠭᠡᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>sedkil -- ygei</transcript>
